{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31362","headline":"奉酬于中丞登越王楼见寄之什 · 杨牢","name":"奉酬于中丞登越王楼见寄之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劒外书来日，惊忙自折封。\n丹青得山水，强健慰心胸。\n事少胜诸郡，江回见几重。\n宁悲久作别，且似一相逢。\n诗合焚香咏，愁应赖酒浓。\n庾楼寒更忆，肠断雪千峰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨牢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31362.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31362","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}